    {
     "title": "General",
     "body": "- Fixed a bug where Battlepass XP was not granted for Stadium Quick Play Matches.\n- Fixed a bug with the \"Solus Victorem 2026 Finals\" Spray.\n- Fixed a bug where the kill feed would sometimes be out of order.\n- Fixed several issues with the After Match Rewards summary.\n- Fixed several issues with the ping system.\n- Removed the High Precision Mouse Input setting, as the problem it was built to solve has now been addressed through other means. The setting's removal does not change how mouse input functions in-game.",
     "dev": null
    },
    {
     "title": "Heroes",
     "body": "**Mercy**\n\n- Fixed an issue causing Mercy's Flash Heal ability to not be counted for the \"Support Ability Mastery\" or \"Master of Life and Death\" daily challenges.\n\n**D.Mon**\n\n- Fixed an issue with the \"Toggle Boosters\" setting.",
     "dev": null
    },
    {
     "title": "Maps",
     "body": "- Fixed a bug with the Black Forest map. It is now re-enabled.",
     "dev": null
    },
    {
     "title": "Stadium",
     "body": "- Fixed an issue where Mercy's Sympathetic Recovery passive wasn't properly working in Stadium.\n- Fixed an issue where Cut 'Em Gracie would sometimes pull targets not stuck by the blade.",
